00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.900
These little ramekins are
already buttered and floured.

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.280
So you can bring 'em on over.

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:09.095
It's supposed to mitigate
mess but I'm pretty messy.

00:02:09.095 --> 00:02:10.910
